    "message": "feat(js): start Chrome for Testing by default without its infobar (#179)\n\nLaunches without channel or executablePath now start the Chrome for\nTesting that Playwright or Puppeteer downloaded, never the user's\nGoogle Chrome. A Chrome for Testing launch gets the new\nchrome-for-testing preset by default: no-chrome-for-testing-infobar\n(--test-type=gpu, the only value Chromium's infobar_utils skips) and\nmock-keychain. Callers can override it with defaultRestrictions.\n\nAlso removes the .gitkeep left by the task commit.",
