    "message": "fix: capture the view without a clip for traces and default screenshots (#180)\n\nPlaywright's page.screenshot sends Page.captureScreenshot with a clip\nset to the viewport; a headful window resized during that capture can\nkeep the emulated size. Trace checkpoint screenshots and default\nscreenshots of pages without a fixed viewport now use CDP\nPage.captureScreenshot without a clip in JS, Python and Rust, and fall\nback to the engine capture where CDP is unavailable.",
    "parents": [{ "sha": "687cf2eb88d11c261a4c328661a442a329cfa343", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/browser-commander/git/commits/687cf2eb88d11c261a4c328661a442a329cfa343", "html_url": "https://github.com/link-foundation/browser-commander/commit/687cf2eb88d11c261a4c328661a442a329cfa343" }],
