    "message": "feat(python): start Chrome for Testing by default without its infobar (#179)\n\nLaunches without channel or executable_path now start the Chrome for\nTesting Playwright downloaded (Selenium also tries the one Selenium\nManager keeps, with --force-browser-download), never the user's Google\nChrome. A Chrome for Testing launch gets the chrome-for-testing preset\nby default (no-chrome-for-testing-infobar and mock-keychain); callers\noverride it with default_restrictions. Also adds the Python changelog\nfragments for #179 and #180.",
