    "message": "fix(js): fall back to Selenium Manager's Chrome for Testing for Selenium (#179)\n\nA Selenium engine launch without Playwright's or Puppeteer's Chrome for\nTesting used to leave the browser to the driver, which starts the\ninstalled Google Chrome. It now asks Selenium Manager for its Chrome for\nTesting (--force-browser-download) and otherwise fails with the install\ncommands, like the other engines. Adds the JS changeset for #179 and\n#180.",
