    "message": "feat(rust): start Chrome for Testing by default without its infobar (#179)\n\nlaunch_browser() and launch_real_browser() without a channel or\nexecutable_path now start Chrome for Testing: the engine's bundled browser\nor the newest one in the Playwright, Puppeteer and Selenium Manager\ncaches, never the user's Google Chrome. When none is installed the launch\nfails with the install command and the channel(\"chrome\") option.\n\nA Chrome for Testing launch gets the chrome-for-testing preset\n(--test-type=gpu, --use-mock-keychain) before the caller's restrictions;\ndefault_restrictions replaces it and launch results report it.\nRealBrowserOptions::channel becomes Option<String>, with browser_channel()\nfor the browser family. Snapshot and cookie-session launches keep naming\ntheir source browser.",
    "parents": [{ "sha": "0d6884c161abd5825d754190886673c25a19d669", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/browser-commander/git/commits/0d6884c161abd5825d754190886673c25a19d669", "html_url": "https://github.com/link-foundation/browser-commander/commit/0d6884c161abd5825d754190886673c25a19d669" }],
